WEBVTT

00:00:02.720 --> 00:00:06.620
I'm Ricardo Garcia, and I tore my life down
to become a completely different person today.

00:00:07.160 --> 00:00:10.850
I come from an adoptive family of
humble origins in the city of Porto.

00:00:11.420 --> 00:00:15.880
At sixteen, I realized I had to be different,
because from the start, I already was.

00:00:16.510 --> 00:00:18.520
I built military discipline in myself.

00:00:18.520 --> 00:00:19.790
Army in 2003.

00:00:20.110 --> 00:00:21.310
Marines in 2008.

00:00:21.970 --> 00:00:23.460
GNR in 2010.

00:00:23.720 --> 00:00:24.880
Fourteen years of service.

00:00:25.160 --> 00:00:28.500
And even so, I left my dream job because
it didn't give me what I needed.

00:00:28.980 --> 00:00:31.610
Liliana, my wife, was fighting breast cancer.

00:00:32.130 --> 00:00:33.710
Constança was three years old.

00:00:34.250 --> 00:00:36.760
We sold the house we loved to
be closer to the treatments.

00:00:37.370 --> 00:00:38.990
The state salary wasn't enough.

00:00:39.470 --> 00:00:41.380
It was three hours of commuting a day.

00:00:41.740 --> 00:00:43.640
I had no freedom and no peace of mind.

00:00:44.100 --> 00:00:46.880
And the post-traumatic stress
from the past was killing me.

00:00:47.410 --> 00:00:49.920
I had to destroy everything to build it all again.

00:00:50.460 --> 00:00:52.180
That's how MoreThanMoney was born.

00:00:52.580 --> 00:00:54.060
It's everything we've built.

00:00:54.700 --> 00:00:59.970
And it's our mission to give you knowledge, tools, and
support so you don't have to pay the price I paid to

00:00:59.970 --> 00:01:00.550
learn alone.

00:01:01.050 --> 00:01:03.070
Here you can learn the markets with a method.

00:01:03.570 --> 00:01:07.150
You can take your business further with
our artificial intelligence solutions.

00:01:07.770 --> 00:01:09.580
And you can work with us as a partner.

00:01:10.160 --> 00:01:11.950
There are no guaranteed results.

00:01:11.950 --> 00:01:14.800
There's work, discipline, and a team by your side.

00:01:15.360 --> 00:01:18.000
If my story touched you, choose your path down below.

00:01:18.300 --> 00:01:19.190
I'm on the other side.